<td id="S5.T2.14.10.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="S5.T2.14.10.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1.00</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="S5.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Prompt reordering yields substantial improvements (0.418<math id="S5.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>0.752 at <math id="S5.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>=4, +80% relative), confirming the “lost in the middle” phenomenon (<span id="S5.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">?</span>). Adding BM25 improves dense-only retrieval by 3.1 percentage points at <math id="S5.SS3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>=16 (0.788<math id="S5.SS3.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>0.819). The retry mechanism provides +69% relative improvement at <math id="S5.SS3.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>=4 (0.488<math id="S5.SS3.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>0.827), effectively addressing abstention failures where the model incorrectly abstains due to insufficient initial context.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.4 </span>LLM Comparison</h3>

<div id="S5.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We compare seven LLMs using Jina v4 embeddings, including open-weight models like GPT-oss-120B (<span id="S5.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">?</span>). Table <a href="#S5.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 5.4 LLM Comparison ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> reports mean scores across 3 runs.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>LLM comparison (final score). Best in <span id="S5.T3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, second <span id="S5.T3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. Significance: <sup id="S5.T3.9" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S5.T3.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup><math id="S5.T3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math><math id="S5.T3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>0.10, <sup id="S5.T3.10" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S5.T3.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">∗</span></sup><math id="S5.T3.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math><math id="S5.T3.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>0.05, <sup id="S5.T3.11" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S5.T3.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">∗∗</span></sup><math id="S5.T3.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math><math id="S5.T3.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>0.01.</figcaption>
