</section>
<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span>Retrieval Configuration</h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figures <a href="#A2.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ BM25 Hybrid Search (Figure ). ‣ B.4 Retrieval Configuration ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>–<a href="#A2.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ BM25 Hybrid Search (Figure ). ‣ B.4 Retrieval Configuration ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> present ablations on retrieval parameters. Key findings:</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Reranking Strategy (Figure <a href="#A2.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ BM25 Hybrid Search (Figure ). ‣ B.4 Retrieval Configuration ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The <span id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Combined</span> strategy (frequency <math id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>+</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+</annotation></semantics></math> score) provides the most consistent results across retrieval depths. Pure frequency-based reranking severely underperforms, indicating that while document frequency provides useful signal, retrieval scores remain important.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Query Planning (Figure <a href="#A2.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ BM25 Hybrid Search (Figure ). ‣ B.4 Retrieval Configuration ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Increasing planner queries from 2 to 6 improves performance substantially at all retrieval depths, with the largest gains at <math id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>=4 (+40%). More queries help capture diverse aspects of complex questions.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompt Reordering (Figure <a href="#A2.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ BM25 Hybrid Search (Figure ). ‣ B.4 Retrieval Configuration ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Placing retrieved context before the question (C<math id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>Q order) dramatically outperforms the standard order, confirming the “lost in the middle” phenomenon. The effect is largest at lower <math id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> values where every piece of context matters.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">BM25 Hybrid Search (Figure <a href="#A2.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ BM25 Hybrid Search (Figure ). ‣ B.4 Retrieval Configuration ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Adding BM25 provides consistent improvements over dense-only retrieval, with optimal performance at BM25 <math id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>=4. Higher BM25 <math id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> values dilute the precision advantage.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F11" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F11.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/top_k_vs_rerank.png" id="A2.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:311/187;" width="311" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Top-<math id="A2.F11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A2.F11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Reranking strategy.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F11.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/planner_queries_vs_top_k.png" id="A2.F11.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:311/187;" width="311" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Planner queries <math id="A2.F11.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Top-<math id="A2.F11.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F13" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F13.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/top_k_vs_reorder.png" id="A2.F13.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:311/187;" width="311" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span>Top-<math id="A2.F13.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A2.F13.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Prompt reordering.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F13.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/bm25_top_k_vs_top_k.png" id="A2.F13.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:311/187;" width="311" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 13: </span>BM25 top-<math id="A2.F13.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A2.F13.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Dense top-<math id="A2.F13.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.5 </span>Context Enhancement</h3>

<div id="A2.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figures <a href="#A2.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Final Top-𝑘 (Figure ). ‣ B.5 Context Enhancement ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>–<a href="#A2.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Final Top-𝑘 (Figure ). ‣ B.5 Context Enhancement ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> show the impact of retry mechanism and final context truncation.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Retry Mechanism (Figure <a href="#A2.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Final Top-𝑘 (Figure ). ‣ B.5 Context Enhancement ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The retry mechanism provides substantial improvement, especially at low <math id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> values (+69% at <math id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>=4). When the model abstains due to insufficient evidence, expanding context and retrying often recovers the correct answer.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Final Top-<math id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> (Figure <a href="#A2.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Final Top-𝑘 (Figure ). ‣ B.5 Context Enhancement ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Truncating reranked results to top-<math id="A2.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{\text{final}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{\text{final}}</annotation></semantics></math>=32 provides optimal balance between coverage and precision. No truncation (using all retrieved results) slightly degrades performance due to noise accumulation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F15" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F15.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/top_k_vs_max_retries.png" id="A2.F15.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:311/187;" width="311" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>Top-<math id="A2.F15.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A2.F15.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Max retries.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F15.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/top_k_vs_top_k_final.png" id="A2.F15.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:311/187;" width="311" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>Top-<math id="A2.F15.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A2.F15.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Top-<math id="A2.F15.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{\text{final}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{\text{final}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.6 </span>LLM Comparison</h3>

<div id="A2.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A2.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ B.6 LLM Comparison ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a> presents a comprehensive comparison across seven LLMs. Grok-4.1-fast achieves the highest overall performance, with Kimi-k2-thinking and Gemini-3-pro as close seconds. Notably, performance rankings vary with retrieval depth: Grok excels at <math id="A2.SS6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>=4, while Gemini shows more consistent performance across all <math id="A2.SS6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> values.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F16" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/llm_model_vs_top_k.png" id="A2.F16.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:454/272;" width="454" height="272" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 16: </span>LLM model <math id="A2.F16.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Top-<math id="A2.F16.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> configuration.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.7 </span>Ensemble Size Scaling</h3>

<div id="A2.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figures <a href="#A2.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Voting Strategies (Figure ). ‣ B.7 Ensemble Size Scaling ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>–<a href="#A2.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Voting Strategies (Figure ). ‣ B.7 Ensemble Size Scaling ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> and Tables <a href="#A2.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Voting Strategies (Figure ). ‣ B.7 Ensemble Size Scaling ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>–<a href="#A2.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ Voting Strategies (Figure ). ‣ B.7 Ensemble Size Scaling ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> present ensemble analysis.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Ensemble Scaling (Figure <a href="#A2.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Voting Strategies (Figure ). ‣ B.7 Ensemble Size Scaling ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Performance exhibits logarithmic scaling with ensemble size, with diminishing returns beyond <math id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>=9–11. The <span id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ignore_blank</span> option consistently improves performance by 1–2%, with larger gains at smaller ensemble sizes where individual blank answers have more impact.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Voting Strategies (Figure <a href="#A2.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Voting Strategies (Figure ). ‣ B.7 Ensemble Size Scaling ‣ Appendix B Complete Sweep Results ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AnswerPriority</span> voting slightly outperforms other strategies, as it ensures reference consistency with the selected answer. <span id="A2.SS7.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Union</span> voting underperforms due to including spurious references from minority votes.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F18" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F18.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/ensemble_vs_ignore_blank.png" id="A2.F18.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:311/187;" width="311" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 17: </span>Ensemble size <math id="A2.F18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> ignore_blank.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F18.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:225.5pt;"><img src="2603.07612v1/images/sweeps/ensemble_vs_ref_vote.png" id="A2.F18.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:311/187;" width="311" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 18: </span>Ensemble size <math id="A2.F18.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> Voting strategy.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
</figure>
