<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Error Analysis</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix presents a comprehensive analysis of prediction errors across our hyperparameter sweeps,
providing insights into the failure modes of RAG systems and informing future improvements.
Understanding <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">why</span> systems fail is as important as measuring <span id="A3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">how often</span> they succeed.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Methodology and Error Categorization</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We analyzed 2,583 predictions across 63 sweep runs (7 LLMs <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> 3 top-<math id="A3.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> settings <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> 3 random seeds)
to categorize failure modes. Each prediction was compared against ground truth using an automated
classification pipeline. Of all predictions, 75.2% were fully correct, with the remaining 24.8%
(641 errors) exhibiting various error types. Table <a href="#A3.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ C.1 Methodology and Error Categorization ‣ Appendix C Error Analysis ‣ KohakuRAG: A simple RAG framework with hierarchical document indexing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> provides a high-level summary.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Summary of error analysis across all sweep configurations.</figcaption>
<table id="A3.T12.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A3.T12.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T12.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T12.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Metric</span></th>
<td id="A3.T12.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T12.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T12.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T12.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">Total predictions analyzed</th>
<td id="A3.T12.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">2,583</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T12.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T12.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Correct predictions</th>
<td id="A3.T12.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1,942 (75.2%)</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T12.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
